--- .gitignore (原始)
Nothing should be ignored since only a Python source file (`orchestrator_bot.py`) was modified and there are no build artifacts, dependencies, or temporary files in the changes.

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Environment
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
target/
```
